      "heading": "B — Audience",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience, Section Five Signals Signs and Markers\n\nThe audience is first-time never-licensed applicants preparing for the Class C non-commercial knowledge test, reading at a plain-English level. Section Five teaches signals, signs, and markings only, from traffic lights and sign codes through warnings, regulations, guides, pavement lines, and work zones; it assumes no prior driving knowledge and carries no prerequisites beyond literacy. Rules progress from light phases and sign shapes to roadside devices and zone discipline.\n",
